#. module: account_invoice_warnings
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_warnings.field_res_company__show_wrong_accounts
msgid "When this setting is set, a warning is displayed on invoice form alerting you that accounts in invoice are wrong."
msgstr "Cuando este parámetro está definido, se mostrará un aviso en la factura alertando que las cuentas de la factura son incorrectas."

#. module: account_invoice_warnings
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_warnings.field_res_company__show_wrong_vat
msgid "When this setting is set, a warning is displayed on invoice form alerting you that partner VAT is missing."
msgstr "Cuando este parámetro está definido, se mostrará un aviso en la factura alertando que falta el NIF del cliente/proveedor."

#. module: account_invoice_warnings
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_warnings.field_res_company__show_wrong_taxes
msgid "When this setting is set, a warning is displayed on invoice form alerting you that taxes in invoice are missing."
msgstr "Cuando este parámetro está definido, se mostrará un aviso en la factura alertando que falta impuestos en las facturas."

